        "Content": "The property is being offered for sale on the\r\ninstructions of Cork City Council\r\n\r\n• End of terraced building in need of refurbishment.\r\n• Site Area of 165 sq.m/1,776 sq.ft.\r\n• On the ground.\r\n• Situated in a prime Cork City Centre location on Lower Glanmire Road.\r\n• Opportunity to redevelop the premises into a modern residential property. (Subject to P.P.)\r\n\r\nThe property is located on Lower Glanmire Road\r\nclose to St. Patrick’s Church and opposite Hertz\r\nCar Rental and Right Price Tiles.\r\n\r\n2 story end-terrace 3 bedroom property, with a\r\nfront yard and back garden. The property is in a\r\nderelict condition and would be able to avail of\r\nthe Vacant Property Refurbishment Grant. The\r\nproperty has access to Lower Glanmire Road.\r\nThe property is on a site area of 165 sq.m/1,776\r\nsq.ft."
